(v) disputes on alleged evasion of duties and taxes through the resort to misdeclaration of [] name and quantity of goods, fraud of documents, violation of import and export policy or violations of customs bonded warehouse related licensing and/or bond related conditions; and
(C) penalty related pending disputes of pre-shipment inspection agency.
